  "about": "Richard Brooks Lewis is a technology entrepreneur - a full-stack developer - engaged in consulting in software engineering across a broad spectrum of industries.\n  \nMr. Lewis is an artisan of software development, a perfectionist who has truly mastered his instrument.  His passion is for blank-slate  projects that require his detailed system-wide knowledge of both hardware and software and his high-definition debug skills.\n\nMr. Lewis, and his company, ASTL, function as a sort of \"A Team\" for emergent technology projects.  Core competence in this arena allows Lewis to thoroughly absorb the project specs, rapidly innovate a working design, and fastidiously complete the development cycle.  During the process, he wholly integrates the client team in each step without becoming dependent on them.\n\nMr. Lewis is a businessman who intimately understands bottom line pressure and has successfully run his own consultancy for 40 years.  During that time, he has worked successfully with every major technology vendor in the U.S. and has the glowing endorsements and references to prove it.\n\nRick is the rare synthesis of decisive business leadership blended with elegant software engineering and fluid communications intelligence.",
