    "description": "ASTL Systems is an integrated systems consulting firm specializing in emergent technology problem-solving and new systems initiation.  Rick Lewis is the principal software engineer and chief consultant for the firm, which he founded in 1975 while a university freshman.  \n\nASTL has consulted for every major hardware and software vendor in the United States with special emphasis on software development and system bring-up.  \n\nRick's core experience and value lies in software architectures designed for test and testing.  His engineering talents are especially unique because they transcend hardware, software and integrated systems.  \n\nSenior managers prize Mr. Lewis' exclusive ability to fluently speak the language of business and exceed even the most challenging project demands.\n\nFor details on past projects and skills, please see the CV and Addendum posted on Mr. Lewis' profile.",
